    devhub_secured_db_key_session_open_failure_2026_10_27, 0, "Pinned P2 producer13d73267e690b2cdd46438315e2bfe6d4d6c0c37bcfc15591a921fc9728b270b. Ledger1 build0 run1. Memory oracle passed AES NIST, independent KDF/HMAC and SQLite rows/overflow. Execution stopped at STAGE fresh direct key-session return with FAIL fresh secured DB direct key session. Encrypted inputs and metadata stayed unchanged; no plaintext or journal secret files. Exact root cause remains unisolated; no further feature experiments authorized this session."
    phase2_octal_permission_mode_lowering_2026_10_27, 0, Producer P2 SHA256 13d73267e690b2cdd46438315e2bfe6d4d6c0c37bcfc15591a921fc9728b270b. Cache unchanged regression compiled and ran exit0 after decimal-mode workaround; artifact e285b95b2f4250817eec5555aee4d67fea0f1f299d2d3d3568381ae8f9b044fd. Earlier actual filesystem inspection observed both files readonly. The exact compiler lowering cause is not yet isolated. Workaround commit pending integration; underlying bug remains open.
    phase2_u8_accelerated_sha256_ffi_carrier_2026_10_27, 0, Producer P2 SHA256 13d73267e690b2cdd46438315e2bfe6d4d6c0c37bcfc15591a921fc9728b270b. Initial native compile0 run1 artifact3adb13de091efe809b6a571ced270f697ee30de9d36d33939692a758dcbaaa8d; independent server observed zero requests. Final typed-carrier transport qualification is recorded in the parent verification report and is not assumed here. Workaround commit pending integration; underlying bug remains open.
    windows_core_http_client_unavailable_2026_10_27, 0, Producer P2 SHA256 13d73267e690b2cdd46438315e2bfe6d4d6c0c37bcfc15591a921fc9728b270b. Source-confirmed Windows provider gap. Actual curl8.21.0 exists on the qualification host. HTTP text and signed binary loopback acceptance remains separately bound to the parent qualification artifacts; source review alone is not runtime PASS. Workaround commit pending integration; underlying bug remains open.
    phase2_result_tuple_try_binding_metadata_2026_10_27, 0, Producer P2 SHA256 13d73267e690b2cdd46438315e2bfe6d4d6c0c37bcfc15591a921fc9728b270b. Earlier Messenger compilation admitted all169 MIR modules after explicit SQLite tuple bindings. Supplemental unsigned varint and truncation checks passed. Production Messenger adapter RTS01 remains unresolved; this workaround is not proof that the database read works. Workaround commit pending integration; underlying bug remains open.
