    phase2_module_static_array_concat_initialization_2026_10_27, 0, "Producer P2 SHA256 13d73267e690b2cdd46438315e2bfe6d4d6c0c37bcfc15591a921fc9728b270b. The retained literal tables were part of the earlier DevHub P2 source repair. Current GH JSON and flag native graphs compile and run successfully, but this is not a new independent replay of the original static-initializer failure. Related older registry issue native_array_concat_dispatch_bootstrap_2026_10_16 remains separate. Workaround commit pending integration; underlying bug remains open."
